OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain slowly clearing the
OL,6,Fsoutheast in the morning. A brighter
OL,7,Fday for many and feeling fresh. Winds
OL,8,Fgradually easing in the north, with
OL,9,Fshowers too.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDrier tonight with a few
OL,12,Fshowers and plenty of clear spells.
OL,13,FLighter winds and feeling chilly,
OL,14,Fparticularly in the countryside.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FLargely dry on Wednesday
OL,17,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. Showers
OL,18,Fgradually easing along the east coast.
OL,19,FTemperatures around or slightly below
OL,20,Faverage for the time of year.
